**Google Flow Rules** (must implement exactly):

| Case | Condition | Action |
|---|---|---|
| A | Google `sub` already in `hwa_identities` | Login linked user |
| B | `sub` unlinked + `email_verified=true` + email matches one WP user + setting enabled | Link identity → login |
| C | `sub` unlinked + no matching user + auto-create enabled | Create WooCommerce customer → link → login |
| D | `sub` unlinked + auto-create disabled | Redirect with error |
| E | Logged-in user + `context=link_google` | Link to current user (if not already linked elsewhere) |

**Estimated complexity**: High. ~10 patches. Requires Google Cloud Console setup for testing.

