## 5. Risk Register

| Risk | Severity | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| Google client library bloats plugin size (~30MB) | Medium | Consider using HTTP-only token validation instead of full `google/apiclient` SDK |
| SMS provider API changes or failures | High | Abstraction layer with fallback error handling; admin test SMS button |
| OAuth state replay attacks | High | Single-use states, 10-min expiry, hash-only storage |
| OTP brute-force (6-digit = 1M combinations) | High | Max 5 attempts per challenge, per-phone + per-IP rate limiting, bcrypt hashing |
| Duplicate accounts from race conditions | Medium | Unique DB constraint on `(provider, identity_hash)`; re-check before create |
| WooCommerce deactivation mid-operation | Medium | Guard all WooC function calls; admin notice when inactive |
| Cart/session loss during checkout login | Medium | Preserve WooCommerce session cookies across OAuth redirect |
| Phone normalization inconsistencies | Medium | E.164 strict format; configurable default country code |

