## 8. Verification Plan

### Automated
- Plugin activates/deactivates without errors (WP-CLI or manual)
- Tables are created correctly on activation (verify via phpMyAdmin / WP-CLI db query)
- Re-activation doesn't duplicate tables
- Settings save and sanitize correctly

### Manual Testing (per phase)

**Phase 1**: Google button appears → redirects to Google → callback creates/logins customer → same user logins again → verified email matching works → invalid state rejected → reused state rejected

**Phase 2**: Phone login with known number → OTP sent → correct OTP logins → unknown number shows "sign up" → phone register → OTP → customer created → existing number shows "login" → wrong/expired OTP fails → rate limiting works

**Phase 3**: Phone user links Google → Google user links phone → conflict blocked → My Account shows correct status → unlinking prevention

### Production Staging
- Test with real Google OAuth credentials on HTTPS staging site
- Test with real SMS provider credentials
- Verify no secrets in debug logs or browser network tab
